DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
5600::$$$message_0038_0000_0000$$$::I've been spacing out in the shed.[lr]::
5601::$$$message_0038_0000_0001$$$::It seems that I fell asleep here after lunch.[lr]::
5602::$$$message_0038_0000_0002$$$::"Mmm... There's nothing here, so I may as well go back."::
5603::$$$message_0038_0001_0000$$$::...Hm. I sense someone in my room.[lr]::
5604::$$$message_0038_0001_0001$$$::"...Who's there?"[lr]::
5605::$$$message_0038_0001_0002$$$::Something is quietly shifting inside.[lr]::
5606::$$$message_0038_0001_0003$$$::Is Sakura looking for laundry...? No that isn't her.::
5607::$$$message_0038_0002_0000$$$::"...Rin. This isn't right."[lr]::
5608::$$$message_0038_0002_0001$$$::"But aren't you curious?"::
5609::$$$message_0038_0003_0000$$$::...What are they doing?[lr]::
5610::$$$message_0038_0003_0001$$$::I'm curious, but if I showed myself now, Tohsaka would just try to hide it.[lr]::
5611::$$$message_0038_0003_0002$$$::"...I'll just watch."::
5612::$$$message_0038_0004_0000$$$::It's unusual that they haven't noticed me at this distance.[lr]::
5613::$$$message_0038_0004_0001$$$::Saber must be distracted, too.::
5614::$$$message_0038_0005_0000$$$::"It doesn't matter whether I'm curious or not.[lr]::
5615::$$$message_0038_0005_0001$$$::This is rude to Shirou."[lr]::
5616::$$$message_0038_0005_0002$$$::"But he might be sneaking into your room without you knowing, too."::
5617::$$$message_0038_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
5618::$$$message_0038_0006_0001$$$::...I'm gonna murder her.[lr]::
5619::$$$message_0038_0006_0002$$$::I've been in Tohsaka's room while she was abroad, but only to clean.::
5620::$$$message_0038_0007_0000$$$::"...I'm sure he'd do no such thing."[lr]::
5621::$$$message_0038_0007_0001$$$::"I dunno... Emiya's a boy at that age, you know. And if he's living with a girl like you, there's no telling what he might try."[lr]::
5622::$$$message_0038_0007_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Murder.[font italic=false][lr]::
5623::$$$message_0038_0007_0003$$$::One more word, and you're dead meat.[chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服13c(遠) textoff=0]::
5624::$$$message_0038_0008_0000$$$::"...Anyway, I don't think it would be in his room."[cacheimage storage=凛私服03b(遠)][wvs][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服03b(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5625::$$$message_0038_0008_0001$$$::"I'd bet that it is, actually... And if I lose this wager, I'll treat you to a meal."[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01a(遠)][wvs][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服01a(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5626::$$$message_0038_0008_0002$$$::"In that case, please buy me some dorayaki from Edomaeya."[lr]::
5627::$$$message_0038_0008_0003$$$::[movefg opacity=255 left=-559 top=0 time=600 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][wait canskip=false time=50 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=460 top=0 time=600 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]...What does Saber have to give up if she loses?[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
5628::$$$message_0038_0009_0000$$$::Tohsaka seems completely confident from where I'm standing.[lr]::
5629::$$$message_0038_0009_0001$$$::...What are they looking for, anyway?::
5630::$$$message_0038_0010_0000$$$::"Okay, let's start over here..."[lr]::
5631::$$$message_0038_0010_0001$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=r accel=-2 storage=凛私服08a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=c accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服07b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-591 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=599 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]...There isn't really anywhere to hide things in this room."[cacheimage storage=凛私服08a(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服08a(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5632::$$$message_0038_0010_0002$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=凛私服08a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=l accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服07b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-498 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=685 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Under the desk, in the back of the drawer...looks fine over here."[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5633::$$$message_0038_0010_0003$$$::[movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=r accel=-2 storage=凛私服08a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-463 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=633 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]It's like they're on a treasure hunt.[lr]::
5634::$$$message_0038_0010_0004$$$::Even though I don't have anything shameful to hide. No hidden savings, either.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
5635::$$$message_0038_0011_0000$$$::"Nothing. Then it might be under the tatami mats or in the closet."[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01a(遠)][wvs][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服01a(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5636::$$$message_0038_0011_0001$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=lc accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服01a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-708 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=522 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]To my recollection, Shirou has never pulled up the tatami mats in this room."[cacheimage storage=凛私服06e(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服06e(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5637::$$$message_0038_0011_0002$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=凛私服06e(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-484 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=715 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Yeah, normally nobody would do that. But you know what a stickler for details he is."[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5638::$$$message_0038_0011_0003$$$::...What am I, a feudal-era ninja?[lr]::
5639::$$$message_0038_0011_0004$$$::First, you can't really hide much under a tatami mat.[lr]::
5640::$$$message_0038_0011_0005$$$::Though it's a different story if you pull up the actual floorboards.[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04a(遠) textoff=0]::
5641::$$$message_0038_0012_0000$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=-675 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=515 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Could it possibly be in the shed?"[cacheimage storage=凛私服01e(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服01e(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5642::$$$message_0038_0012_0001$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=-482 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=717 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Oh... There's plenty of space to hide it, and Shirou does go in there every night. But a mage would try his best to avoid placing anything in his workshop that might distract from his focus."[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01a(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服01a(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5643::$$$message_0038_0012_0002$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=-712 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=475 top=0 time=400 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]I see. Distractions can be deadly."[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5644::$$$message_0038_0012_0003$$$::[movefg opacity=255 left=-585 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=434 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]There's plenty of junk to distract me, though.[lr]::
5645::$$$message_0038_0012_0004$$$::And that's rich coming from Tohsaka, who's moved strength training equipment into her basement.::
5646::$$$message_0038_0013_0000$$$::...But seriously, what are they looking for that could be so distracting to me?[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服01d(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5647::$$$message_0038_0013_0001$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=-430 top=0 time=100 accel=0 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=434 top=0 time=100 accel=0 layer=4 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=100 pos=l accel=0 storage=セイバー私服01a(遠) textoff=0]……[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-498 top=0 time=600 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=708 top=0 time=700 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Here! This is what I've been looking for."[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01c(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服01c(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5648::$$$message_0038_0013_0002$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=r accel=-2 storage=凛私服01d(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=500 pos=lc accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服01c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-702 top=0 time=600 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=503 top=0 time=600 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Don't tell me he really had it, Rin!?"[cacheimage storage=凛私服05c(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服05c(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5649::$$$message_0038_0013_0003$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=500 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=凛私服05c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=l accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服01c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-510 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=673 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Emiya wouldn't hide food in a place like this, so I'm sure we've hit bingo."[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
5650::$$$message_0038_0014_0000$$$::[movefg opacity=255 time=500 top=145 left=480 accel=-2 storage=凛私服05c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-512 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=575 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]A candy box?[lr]::
5651::$$$message_0038_0014_0001$$$::Was I hiding something like that?[lr]::
5652::$$$message_0038_0014_0002$$$::...Wait, try and remember. If I recall...[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
5653::$$$message_0038_0015_0000$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=lc accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服10a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-650 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=528 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]No, we can't determine that until we look inside."[cacheimage storage=凛私服03b(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服03b(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5654::$$$message_0038_0015_0001$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=凛私服03b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=l accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服10a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-515 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=685 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]You don't know when to give up, Saber... Okay, let's see.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=凛私服09e(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服09e(遠) textoff=0] Wow."[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(遠)][wvs][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5655::$$$message_0038_0015_0002$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=lc accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=r accel=-2 storage=凛私服09e(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-695 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=495 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Shirou has something like this..."[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5656::$$$message_0038_0015_0003$$$::[movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=l accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-538 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=599 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0][line len=3]I remember now.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
5657::$$$message_0038_0016_0000$$$::I didn't want to leave it lying around, so I put it in a random box.[lr]::
5658::$$$message_0038_0016_0001$$$::And I put it all the way inside in case Saber or someone else opened it by accident...[lr]::
5659::$$$message_0038_0016_0002$$$::It was a[shock vmax=10 time=1200 count=10] photo album...for viewers aged 18 and up...[wshock canskip=0]::
5660::$$$message_0038_0017_0000$$$::"[chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服09a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=凛私服09a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-510 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=680 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Wow, this is pretty intense...[lr]::
5661::$$$message_0038_0017_0001$$$::I always thought Emiya might be some closet freak..."[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服10c頬(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服10c頬(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5662::$$$message_0038_0017_0002$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=r accel=-2 storage=凛私服09a(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=lc accel=0 storage=セイバー私服10c頬(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-689 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=535 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]I refuse to believe it. Shirou would never have such vulgar feelings for obscene material like this!"[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5663::$$$message_0038_0017_0003$$$::...Thanks for believing in me, Saber.[lr]::
5664::$$$message_0038_0017_0004$$$::But you're giving me too much credit. And...ah, I remember how I got it now.[se storage=se522.wav][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服08c(遠) textoff=0]::
5665::$$$message_0038_0018_0000$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=l accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服10c頬(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=400 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=凛私服08c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-505 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=709 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]Ah-ha... I know what he's into now.[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5666::$$$message_0038_0018_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服08e頬(遠) textoff=0][move time=150 path=(422,151,255)(422,146,255)(426,154,255)(422,146,255)(427,151,255)(419,144,255) storage=凛私服08e頬(遠) accel=-2 textoff=0]Shirou likes big sister types. Oh, this one's more little sister-like.[lr]::
5667::$$$message_0038_0018_0002$$$::I don't see any blondes, though..."[wvs][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5668::$$$message_0038_0018_0003$$$::"[chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服07b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-662 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=500 pos=lc accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服07b(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=683 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]...Is that true?"[wvs][wm canskip=0][se storage=se522.wav][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5669::$$$message_0038_0018_0004$$$::"[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06e(遠) textoff=0]See, I knew you'd be curious."[lr]::
5670::$$$message_0038_0018_0005$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服05d頬(遠) textoff=0]I don't know what else she's going to insinuate about me, so I'd better step in.[movefg opacity=255 left=-526 top=0 time=800 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=516 top=0 time=800 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0][lr]::
5671::$$$message_0038_0018_0006$$$::It would be safest to clear up this misunderstanding as soon as I can.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
5672::$$$message_0038_0019_0000$$$::"[chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服08a(遠),セイバー私服20d(遠) textoff=0][se storage=se188.wav][movefg opacity=255 left=-1010 top=0 time=800 accel=2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=1010 top=0 time=800 accel=2 layer=4 textoff=0]That's Shinji's."[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5673::$$$message_0038_0019_0001$$$::"[line len=8]!!!"::
5674::$$$message_0038_0020_0000$$$::"[move time=300 path=(144,132,255)(154,136,255)(125,135,255)(132,136,255) storage=セイバー私服10c(遠) accel=-1 textoff=0]Shirou!?"[cacheimage storage=凛私服13a(遠)][wvs][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服13a(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5675::$$$message_0038_0020_0001$$$::"Shinji said I would like those and pushed them onto me. I knew it would be awkward to have them out in the open, so I only hid them."[lr]::
5676::$$$message_0038_0020_0002$$$::"Wha..."::
5677::$$$message_0038_0021_0000$$$::Yeah. [chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服01c(遠) textoff=0]Shinji's such a busybody from time to time.[lr]::
5678::$$$message_0038_0021_0001$$$::It isn't good to push your hobbies on other people... But if you told me he likes older girls, I'd believe you.::
5679::$$$message_0038_0022_0000$$$::"I totally forgot about them. Thanks, Tohsaka."[lr]::
5680::$$$message_0038_0022_0001$$$::I thank her and flash the biggest grin I can manage. Of course, the veins are bulging in my temples.[lr]::
5681::$$$message_0038_0022_0002$$$::Heh heh heh. She needs a taste of her own medicine sometimes.::
5682::$$$message_0038_0023_0000$$$::"Ah..."[lr]::
5683::$$$message_0038_0023_0001$$$::"Sorry. I guess I got your hopes up.[lr]::
5684::$$$message_0038_0023_0002$$$::But I wouldn't buy stuff like this."[lr]::
5685::$$$message_0038_0023_0003$$$::It's a waste of money. And I could get them for free at work.[lr]::
5686::$$$message_0038_0023_0004$$$::...That last part's really a secret, though, so I won't mention it.[lr]::
5687::$$$message_0038_0023_0005$$$::Tohsaka's hands shake, as if embarrassed she jumped to conclusions.::
5688::$$$message_0038_0024_0000$$$::"W-why do you have something from Shinji's collection!?"[lr]::
5689::$$$message_0038_0024_0001$$$::She flies into a rage all on her own.::
5690::$$$message_0038_0025_0000$$$::"W-what? You're the one who snuck in here to look for it. I didn't do anything wrong!"[lr]::
5691::$$$message_0038_0025_0001$$$::"Shut up! All mages are on a quest for hidden truths!"[lr]::
5692::$$$message_0038_0025_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04e(遠) textoff=0]That is some impressive mental gymnastics.[lr]::
5693::$$$message_0038_0025_0003$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服14b(近) textoff=0]And if it were true, then all such seekers of the known would need to worry about friendly fire.::
5694::$$$message_0038_0026_0000$$$::"Rin... Does this mean I won our wager?"[lr]::
5695::$$$message_0038_0026_0001$$$::"But we just caught Shirou with them."[lr]::
5696::$$$message_0038_0026_0002$$$::"He said that these belong to Shinji Matou, not him. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01a(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服01a(遠) textoff=0][line len=3]Please treat me to dorayaki from Edomaeya."::
5697::$$$message_0038_0027_0000$$$::Saber's tone doesn't leave room for disagreement.[lr]::
5698::$$$message_0038_0027_0001$$$::It doesn't seem to be just because food is involved either.::
5699::$$$message_0038_0028_0000$$$::"Hmph. Fine, I'll go buy it right now.[lr]::
5700::$$$message_0038_0028_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服16c(近) textoff=0]Ugh, I need some fresh air after seeing that..."::
5701::$$$message_0038_0029_0000$$$::[movefg opacity=0 left=482 top=65 time=300 accel=2 storage=凛私服16c(近) textoff=0]Tohsaka leaves, grumbling all the while.[se storage=se444.wav][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5702::$$$message_0038_0029_0001$$$::The typhoon has passed.[lr]::
5703::$$$message_0038_0029_0002$$$::If[line len=2]and I mean this purely hypothetically[line len=2]I had chosen those myself, I would've felt so ashamed of myself I'd want to die.[lr]::
5704::$$$message_0038_0029_0003$$$::The same way I'd feel if they found my [font italic=true]actual[font italic=false] secret stash even deeper in my drawers.::
5705::$$$message_0038_0030_0000$$$::"Saved by the skin of my teeth... Thanks, Shinji."[lr]::
5706::$$$message_0038_0030_0001$$$::"I'm relieved. I was sure that you're a pure and virtuous Master, Shirou."[lr]::
5707::$$$message_0038_0030_0002$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]Huh!? Uh...yeah, I'll do my best to avoid misunderstandings like that."[lr]::
5708::$$$message_0038_0030_0003$$$::"But you don't find blonde hair...[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服04c(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04c(遠) textoff=0]no, never mind."::
5709::$$$message_0038_0031_0000$$$::...Best to drop the subject.[chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服04e頬(遠) textoff=0][lr]::
5710::$$$message_0038_0031_0001$$$::If this goes on any further, they might catch on about my second Pandora's box.::
5711::$$$message_0038_0032_0000$$$::"I-it's almost three o'clock.[lr]::
5712::$$$message_0038_0032_0001$$$::Let's go wait for Tohsaka in the living room. I'll brew you some tea to go along with your prize."[lr]::
5713::$$$message_0038_0032_0002$$$::"Yes. It's our complete victory."[lr]::
5714::$$$message_0038_0032_0003$$$::Saber smiles happily.[lr]::
5715::$$$message_0038_0032_0004$$$::Urgh, sorry, Saber. I think [font italic=true]I'm[font italic=false] the only one who truly won here...::
905688::$$$message_9038_0024_0000$$$::"W-why do you have something from Shinji's collection!?"[r]::

